Package: freedomnas-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, freedomnas-core, freedomnas-profiles, python3 (>= 3.8), dialog, gdisk, dosfstools, zfsutils-freedomnas | zfsutils-linux, dracut, efibootmgr, parted, curl
Recommends: debootstrap
Description: Profile-driven FreedomNAS installer
 Interactive TUI installer that provisions FreedomNAS in either of two ways:
  • clean install — partitioning, ZFS root pool, base system (the edition's
    own bootstrapper or a rootfs tarball), packages, boot chain
  • in-place install — turns the running system into a FreedomNAS by
    installing the missing packages and enabling their services
 .
 Every OS command comes from freedomnas-profiles through freedomnas-core's
 engine, including the chroot invocation, so the installer itself contains
 no distribution-specific commands. The boot-chain assets (Clover,
 zz-dracut-uki) are provided by freedomnas-profiles.
